g, length and quantity, plus polarity for MTP/MPO assemblies and your needed-by date.</p></div></div><div class="custom-fiber-cta xjri1g2 fb"><p class="xdrf2xf">Need Connectors Built to Your Exact Spec?</p><p class="x7efv2t">Connector, polish, jacket and length, we can source and build any patch cord or assembly to match your spec.</p><a class="talk-to-a-specifier-button x2urddb" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xvkflym">Talk to a Specifier</p><svg class="xquoydi icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 0 0 L 6.75 6.75 L 0 13.5 Z" fill-opacity="var(--icon-alpha, 0)" fill="var(--icon-color, rgb(0, 0, 0))" transform="translate(13.5 5.25)"></path><path d="M 0 0 L 9.75 0" fill="transparent" stroke-dasharray="" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="var(--icon-stroke, 1.5)" stroke="var(--icon-color, rgb(0, 0, 0))" transform="translate(3.75 12)"></path><path d="M 0 0 L 6.75 6.75 L 0 13.5 Z" fill="transparent" stroke-dasharray="" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="var(--icon-stroke, 1.5)" stroke="var(--icon-color, rgb(0, 0, 0))" transform="translate(13.5 5.25)"></path></svg></a></div></section><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="Your partner for telecommunications and fiber optic supply." title="Quick Links" menu1="VOCOM AI" menu2="Services" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link2="/vocom-services" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
